<title>USA: Financial Federal sets 3-for-2 stock payout.</title>
<headline>Financial Federal sets 3-for-2 stock payout.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Federal Corp said Tuesday its board of directors had set a three-for-two stock dividend under which a dividend of one share of common stock will be paid on July 30 for each two shares of common stock to shareholders of record on July 18.</p>
<p>The company said a cash payment will be made in lieu of fractional shares.</p>
<p>At July 8, the company had 9,842,482 shares of common stock outstanding, equivalent to 14,763,723 shares after giving effect to the stock dividend.</p>
